  "body": "CCC and Title Issues - Ready To Move In\r\n\r\nNestled in one of Auckland’s most desirable suburbs, each townhouse is perfectly positioned just moments from the lively Takapuna Centre.\r\n\r\nImagine mornings spent strolling along the golden sands of Takapuna Beach, afternoons exploring boutique shops or savoring world-class cuisine, and evenings unwinding by the peaceful shores of Lake Pupuke.\r\n\r\nWith outstanding transport links, effortless motorway access, North Shore Hospital nearby, and zoning for Auckland’s top schools, every amenity you desire is right at your doorstep.\r\n\r\nA Selection of Distinctive Residences\r\n\r\nChoose from a range of thoughtfully designed floorplans, each tailored to enhance your lifestyle:\r\n\r\nLot 1:\r\n4 Bedrooms | 3.5 Bathrooms \r\nSingle Garage\r\nApprox. 180sqm (incl. 7.4sqm balcony)\r\n\r\nLot 2:\r\n4 Bedrooms | 3.5 Bathrooms \r\nSingle Garage\r\nApprox. 153sqm (incl. 7.4sqm balcony)\r\n\r\nLot 3 & 4:\r\n3 Bedrooms | 3.5 Bathrooms\r\nSingle Garage\r\nApprox. 153sqm (incl. 7.4sqm balcony)\r\n\r\nLot 5:\r\n4 Bedrooms | 3.5 Bathrooms \r\nSingle Garage\r\nApprox. 153sqm (incl. 7.4sqm balcony)\r\n\r\nLot 6:\r\n4 Bedrooms | 3.5 Bathrooms\r\nDouble Garage\r\nApprox. 246sqm (incl. 11.4sqm balcony)\r\n\r\nThoughtfully Crafted Features for Modern Comfort\r\n\r\nEvery detail is designed to delight your senses and simplify your life:\r\nGourmet gas cooktop & walk-in pantry—perfect for culinary creativity\r\nLuxurious full-sized bathtub (Lot 6 only)—your personal relaxation retreat\r\nPrivate backyard oasis, ideal for gatherings or quiet moments\r\nExpansive balconies for effortless indoor-outdoor living\r\nFully tiled bathrooms, elegant LED lighting, premium insulation, and double-glazed windows\r\nYear-round comfort with two heat pumps in each home\r\nFreehold title—no residential society levies\r\n10-Year Master Builder Guarantee\r\n\r\nEducation Excellence—The Best for Your Family\r\n\r\nBenefit from access to Auckland’s top educational institutions:\r\nTakapuna School\r\nTakapuna Normal Intermediate\r\nWestlake Girls’ High School\r\nTakapuna Grammar School\r\n\r\nA Place Where You Belong\r\n\r\nThese homes are more than an address—they are a sanctuary for families, professionals, and investors who value style, comfort, and connection. Sun-filled interiors, peaceful outdoor spaces, and sophisticated finishes invite you to relax, entertain, and truly feel at home.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.\r\nIndulge in the lifestyle you deserve—welcome home to Takapuna.--",
